id: pm-gh1579
title: "GH-1579: Make inferred completion timestamps observable on close"
description: "pm close: completed_at silently defaults to close time, so retroactive closes record delivery days late with no way to tell"
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: agent-ux,"gh:1579",lifecycle,sdk
